<Layout title="Personal - Gan Shen">
    <h1>Personal</h1>
    <p>
        I'm from <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Suzhou">Suzhou</a>,
        China, a beautiful city with over 2500 years of history and rich culture
        heritage, renowned for its <a
            href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Classical_Gardens_of_Suzhou"
            >classical Chinese gardens</a
        >.
    </p>
    <p>
        My Chinese name is <span lang="zh-CN">沈赣</span>. My given name <span
            lang="zh-CN">赣</span
        > (Gan) is a reference to the <a
            href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jiangxi">Jiangxi</a
        > province of China, my mother's home state.
    </p>
    <p>
        In my free time, I enjoy <a href="https://www.instagram.com/gan.shen/"
            >photography</a
        >, rock climbing, and video games. I also like playing table tennis. I'm
        a member of <a href="https://en.mindfulpeace.org/"
            >Mindful Peace International</a
        >.
    </p>
</Layout>
